The point is here that the coordinatewise product of a symmetric and an anti-symmetric cochain is again anti-symmetric.

If now $\cZ$ is a big family and $X$ is a Borel subset, using this section, we may give an explicit formula for the Mayer-Vietoris boundary 
\[
\delta_{\mathrm{MV}} : HX^n(\partial X \Cap \cZ) \longrightarrow HX^{n+1}(\cZ),
