In conclusion, the proposed Sig-PCA approach effectively extracts lower-dimensional path signature summaries to reconstruct model outputs. While leveraging these summaries, localized observation corrections are also learnt; integrating both data sources to produce more reliable and accurate estimates. In particular, most statistics used in validation
