     The OR gate parameters are $\bar{r}_{0Y} = \bar{r}_{0Z} = 0$, $\bar{r}_{1Y} = \bar{r}_{1Z} = 2$, $\bar{r}_{2Z} = 10$, and $\omega = 1$, which are the same as in Fig.~\ref{fig:FFL1}.} 
