and memory limits). TO and MO means that the time or memory limit was
reached, respectively.

To evaluate the effect of the presented algorithms, we used a~total of 9,450
benchmarks from \NfaBench~\cite{NfaBench}, which gathers automata benchmarks from diverse applications.
