It is obvious that \autoref{coor} is equivalent to \autoref{coorfree}. 
Now the main result of \cite{KZ} is formulated as follows:

\begin{theorem}
\Label{mainold} 
A  smooth strictly pseudoconvex  real hypersurface $M\subset\CC{n+1},\,n\geq 1$,
