 \big(\pmb{\mathsf{A}}^{\textrm{L},n}\GRAD f^n_h, \, \GRAD w \big) 
 =0, \quad n = 0, 1, \ldots, N_T.
\end{equation*}
By inserting $w=f^n_h$ into the last equality and taking into account the identity
$
(a-b)b = \frac12(a^2 - b^2 - (a-b)^2),
