\begin{tabular}{ll|cc|cc}
& & & \hspace{-14mm} in bulk & & \hspace{-14mm} on surface \\
mode & coupler & $E_{\mathrm{max}}$ & $B_{\mathrm{max}}$ & $E_{\mathrm{max}}$ & $B_{\mathrm{max}}$ \\ \hline
fixed & large & 9.2 & 9.3 & 25.3 & 28.2 \\
